{"title":"Pit Props","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The new workings in the Underleaf Silver Mine need timber to hold the roof up, and young hill giants in the valley keep scattering Dace Morrow&#39;s felling crew.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/dace-morrow\">Dace Morrow</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"dace-morrow\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/oak-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/d9fa71983c11781e5099.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Wood</a> <b>×15</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/dace-morrow\">Dace Morrow</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Underleaf Silver Mine)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"dace-morrow\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Kill 8 hill giant youths <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Bring 15 oak wood to Dace Morrow <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/oak-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/d9fa71983c11781e5099.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Wood</a> <span clas